OL,3,APolice boss vows to expel racists and
OL,4,Amisogynists
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police chief has admitted his force
OL,7,Fincludes racists, misogynists and
OL,8,Fpeople who abused their power but said
OL,9,Fhe was working to identify and remove
OL,10,Fthem.
OL,12,FDevon and Cornwall Police Chief
OL,13,FConstable James Vaughan said he was
OL,14,Fdoing everything in his power to remove
OL,15,F"bad officers". "There is zero
OL,16,Ftolerance here, there is no room to
OL,17,Fhide," he said.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
